{"id": "EUVD-2026-103632", "enisaUuid": "9faa62fd-2164-35b4-a6d4-56a3d4a2a784", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nfirewire: cdev: fix back-transition for iso_resource_auto client resource\n\nThe todo member of iso_resource_auto structure represents the state of the\nclient resource and normally transitions in the following order:\n\n    ISO_RES_AUTO_ALLOC -> ISO_RES_AUTO_REALLOC -> ISO_RES_AUTO_DEALLOC\n\nHowever, concurrent access from the work item and the file descriptor\nrelease function can cause the state to transition backwards from\nISO_RES_AUTO_DEALLOC to ISO_RES_AUTO_REALLOC.\n\nPrevent the back-transition by checking the current state before\nupdating it in the work item.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:19:00", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:22:12", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ee1df60a0d0e8ab4b00137135733bdadd6d33dab", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c6b51091cafff9ce6c03c1416aa13864d17ab97c"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98587", "GHSA-7hq7-xmgm-jjr4"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "28a1ca9d-0e5b-39c2-b501-6420f5f4ba64", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fcabbf40fae501379b4f3a057febe92d4b0ebdd8 <ee1df60a0d0e8ab4b00137135733bdadd6d33dab"}, {"id": "55ee8e94-bf84-3b64-bac7-ddce557f34b5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fcabbf40fae501379b4f3a057febe92d4b0ebdd8 <c6b51091cafff9ce6c03c1416aa13864d17ab97c"}, {"id": "567400b0-e493-3b28-a693-4f7a85941f18", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "74652dd4-ce2a-3b1c-87b1-6237cb563805", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.9"}, {"id": "997254de-22f4-37b6-a98f-9820980ce1e4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "e5240e9f-c728-3862-b747-af3c6ed5fa5b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ff232e26-1001-36a1-bcd7-5ee4d7736eb2", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}